# Restless Fortress: "This land enters tapped. {T}: Add {W} or {B}" (CR 614.1c, 605.1a). Bot1 plays it on turn 1: it enters tapped and cannot be tapped for mana (refused). On turn 3 it adds
# white, and not red or green (refused). On turn 5 it adds black.

[Bot1 Deck]
Restless Fortress
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Restless Fortress.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Fortress.Tapped = true
! Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Fortress.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: White)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Fortress.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: Red)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Fortress.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Fortress.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: White)
? Bot1.Mana = {W}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Fortress.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: Black)
? Bot1.Mana = {B}

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {B}
